:ctml

class A
class B

Bot == ~Top
//│ OK

Top == ~Bot
//│ OK

A <= ~B
//│ OK

:e
~A <= B
//│ ═══[ERROR] Cannot solve judgment ¬A ≤ B.
//│ Typing error tree:
//│   ¬A ≤ B

:fixme
(A & ~A) == Bot
//│ ═══[ERROR] Cannot solve judgment A ∧ ¬A ≡ ⊥.
//│ Typing error tree:
//│   A ∧ ¬A ≡ ⊥
//│     A ∧ ¬A ≤ ⊥
//│       A ≤ ⊥
//│       ¬A ≤ ⊥
